OL,3,ANorway mourns King Harald as Haakon
OL,4,AVIII ascends throne
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorwegians are grieving the death of
OL,7,Fthe beloved King Harald V, as a period
OL,8,Fof national mourning begins and his son
OL,9,FHaakon VIII assumes the throne.
OL,11,FAfter Harald's death was announced
OL,12,Fearly on Friday, crowds amassed at the
OL,13,Froyal palace in Oslo, laying flowers
OL,14,Fand flags, some mourners visibly in
OL,15,Ftears.
OL,17,FThe 53-year-old new king held an
OL,18,Fextraordinary council of state meeting
OL,19,Fwith government ministers, saying he
OL,20,Fwas taking on the royal family's motto
OL,21,F"All for Norway".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
